      "value": "Marking this as complete, because in AV3, you can easily replace the crouch animation and change the behavior. \nAlso, we tweaked crouch a bit and considering nobody's noted any further issues in here for nearly a year, yeah, let's just call this good for now. \nMake a new Feedback item if you have further issues!",
